            "review_title": "Review at La Cà",
            "review_text": "Kiki L\n4 contributions\n0\nTo flee,\nNov 2023 • Couples\nTablecloth with holes, no napkin or sauce on the table. Our order: chicken soup and seafood soup, fried chicken spring rolls and fried chicken wings (2).\nSoups, served in a small bowl (coffee cup limit) seafood soup: pieces of crab cartilage (very small), small piece of unpeeled shrimp. My husband didn't finish his soup because it had no taste. Regarding the spring rolls: served with mayonnaise!!! Never seen this in Vietnam, although we've been sailing there for a month. I waited quite a while for my chicken wings, served with a few tiny leaves of I don't know what, a tiny lemon with a salt and pepper mixture. I ended up asking for towels, it's a roll of PQ in a box... My advice: run away. In the end we paid 285,000dg (with 2 beers).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 7, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
