            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_2",
            "review_title": "Review at La Cà",
            "review_text": "Luca F\nCan Tho, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nHorrific food\nOct 2017 • Couples\nDon't waste your money. You can find much better food for cheaper prices anywhere in Can Tho. I've been here few times over the last 2 years and things are getting worse. The food quality is just embarrassing. Last time I ordered a beef steak and it was the worst I've ever had in my entire life... Inedible. Also the rest of the dishes were extremely disappointing... especially for those prices. If you ask to the local people they will confirm the bad reputation. The service was ok.. And the location is fine. If you go there for drinking some beers it could be fine, but if you need order some food, you better choose another place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 22, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
