            "review_text": "ChristineBindert\nCascais, Portugal1135 contributions\n0\nBest cheap Vietnamese in Can Tho\nJan 2017 • Friends\nIf you want to eat like the locals, this is the place to go. It is a typical Vietnamese restaurant where locals like to go, many different dishes, service is good but no english spoken. It is also very cheap and suitable for all: from backpackers to tourists with a bit of curiosity but fatter wallet! obvioulsy not for those who want a western style restaurant and clean bathrooms! Portions are huge so you can easily split one dish, best share two or three different ones, you will not be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 3, 2017",
